{
  "la": {
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_NAME": "Pathfinder",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SUBTITLE": "Aves rapaces",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_DESCRIPTION": "Pathfinder est pugnator callidus et evasivus qui cum fideli falcone suo, Squall, pugnat.<color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > Comparatus cum aliis pugnatoribus comminus satis fragilis es; velocibus pedibus, longitudine teli et distractionibus Squall utere ut supersis.\n\n< ! > Inter Pedem Levem et iaculationem hastae alterna ut quam plurimas hastas iacias, sed unum usum artis ad vitandum serva cum opus est.\n\n< ! > Bolae Electricae egregie magnos hostium greges simul cohibent, dum Ungues Lacerantes damnum ingens inferre possunt cum rebus quae tempus in aere augent.\n\n< ! > Squall pugnator peritissimus est; saepe ei impera et res celeritatem oppugnandi atque fortunam ictuum criticorum augentes praefer ut pila celerius repleatur.</color>",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_LORE": "\"Stulte maledicte, hoc non est Red Snubtail, sed mus Rosy Quillback! Murem perperam cepisti.\"\n\n\"Quid refert? Pellem rubram et caudam brevem habet; hunc capiamus et opus finiamus.\"\n\n\"Iam diximus: snubtails speciem quillbacks imitantur ut praedatores deterreant, ergo pilos inspicere debes ne aculei parvi lateant. Praeterea quillbacks insectis tantum vescuntur; ideo vetui te insecta viva pro esca ponere, ne unum casu alliceres. Num descriptiones bestiarii quas tibi ostendi omnino legisti?\"\n\n\"Paucos aculeos in clunibus habet, quid tum? Hunc murem damnatum iam tres dies persecuti sumus. Praeterea cliens noster est dives superbus qui bestiam exoticam aliis amicis divitibus ostentare vult; discrimen numquam agnoscent. Hic paulum pungit, non curabunt.\"\n\n\"Oblitusne es quillbacks <i>venenatos</i> esse, ingeniose? Discrimen profecto sentient cum bestiam permulserint et postero mane a capite ad pedes paralytici evigilaverint. Visne nos homicidii per neglegentiam accusari, stulte?\"\n\n\"Venenati sunt?\"\n\n\"................... Ubi sunt chirothecae tuae?\"\n\n\"...\"\n\n\"Novum socium quaeram.\"\n\n",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "..atque ita discesserunt, novi reges catenae cibi.",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_OUTRO_FAILURE": "..atque ita evanuerunt, in silvis indifferentibus in perpetuum perditi.",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_DEFAULT_SKIN_NAME": "Ordinarius",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_MASTERY_SKIN_NAME": "Venator Capitum",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_PASSIVE_NAME": "Falconarius",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "Falco roboticus tuus, Squall, te comitatur. Squall <style=cIsDamage>pleraque</style> rerum tuarum hereditat et damno immunis est, sed <style=cIsUtility>pila</style> alitur.",
    "KEYWORD_BATTERY": "<style=cKeywordName>Pila</style><style=cSub>Squall duos modos habet: <color=#FF0000>Impetus</color> et <color=#00FF00>Sequere</color>. In <color=#FF0000>Modo Impetendi</color>, Squall pilam celeriter <style=cIsDamage>exhaurit</style>. In <color=#00FF00>Modo Sequendi</color>, Squall pilam <style=cIsHealing>regenerat</style> pro ratione <style=cIsUtility>celeritatis oppugnandi</style>.</style>",
    "KEYWORD_PIERCE": "<style=cKeywordName>Transfigens</style><style=cSub>Ictus <style=cIsUtility>cuspide</style> pro eo <style=cIsDamage>325% damni</style> infert et <style=cIsDamage>armaturam praeterit</style>.</style>",
    "KEYWORD_ELECTROCUTE": "<style=cKeywordName>Concussio electrica</style><style=cSub>Celeritas motus hostium 50% minuitur et <style=cIsDamage>120% damni</style> singulis secundis patiuntur.</style>",
    "KEYWORD_ATTACK": "<style=cKeywordName><color=#FF0000>Impetus</color></style><style=cSub>Attentionem Squall ad hostem destinatum dirige et <color=#FF0000>Modum Impetendi</color> activa, sclopetis automaticis <style=cIsDamage>2x30% damni</style> inferentibus et iaculatore missilium <style=cIsDamage>150% damni</style> inferente concesso.</style>",
    "KEYWORD_FOLLOW": "<style=cKeywordName><color=#00FF00>Sequere</color></style><style=cSub>Squall ad te revoca et <color=#00FF00>Modum Sequendi</color> activa, eum prope te manere faciens.</style>",
    "KEYWORD_SQUALL_SPECIAL": "<style=cKeywordName><color=#efeb1c>Speciale - Pete Iugulum!</color></style><style=cSub>Iube Squall hostem destinatum repetite ferire pro <style=cIsDamage>70% damni</style>. Quisque ictus breviter <style=cIsDamage>armaturam</style> lacerat et <style=cIsUtility>1% pilae regenerat</style>, in Ictibus Criticis duplicatum. Haec ars pilam breviter <style=cIsUtility>superonerare</style> potest.</style>",
    "KEYWORD_UNPOLISHED": "<style=cKeywordName>Imperfecta</style> <style=cSub>Huic arti effectus visibiles et soni desunt, et fortasse plures errores quam aliae habet.</style>",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_PRIMARY_THRUST_NAME": "Ictus",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_PRIMARY_THRUST_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Transfigens</style>. Hastam tuam antrorsum impelle pro <style=cIsDamage>250% damni</style>.",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SECONDARY_DASH_NAME": "Pes Levis",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SECONDARY_DASH_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Procurre</style> breve spatium. Proxima vice qua arte primaria uteris, hastam <style=cIsDamage>explosivam</style> iace pro <style=cIsDamage>800% damni</style>.",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SECONDARY_JAVELIN_NAME": "Hasta Explosiva",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SECONDARY_JAVELIN_DESCRIPTION": "Hastam <style=cIsDamage>explosivam</style> iace pro <style=cIsDamage>800% damni</style>.",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_UTILITY_SPIN_NAME": "Ungues Lacerantes",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_UTILITY_SPIN_DESCRIPTION": "In aerem surge, celeriter rotans pro <style=cIsDamage>300% damni</style>. In terram descendens, tractum horizontalem fac pro <style=cIsDamage>800% damni</style>.",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_UTILITY_BOLAS_NAME": "Bolae Electricae",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_UTILITY_BOLAS_DESCRIPTION": "Bolas electricas iace quae hostes propinquos <style=cIsUtility>concutiunt</style> et campum <style=cIsUtility>electrificantem</style> per <style=cIsUtility>10 secunda</style> relinquunt.",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SPECIAL_COMMAND_NAME": "Iube",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SPECIAL_COMMAND2_NAME": "Iube - Superscriptio Utilitatis",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SPECIAL_COMMAND_DESCRIPTION": "Praepara mandatum pro Squall. Mandatum <color=#FF0000>Impetus</color>, <color=#00FF00>Sequere</color> aut <color=#efeb1c>Speciale</color> dare potes premendo claves artis Primariae, Secundariae aut Specialis respective.",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SPECIAL_ATTACK_NAME": "Mandatum Impetus",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SPECIAL_ATTACK_DESCRIPTION": "Attentionem Squall ad hostem destinatum dirige et <color=#FF0000>Modum Impetendi</color> activa, sclopetis automaticis <style=cIsDamage>2x30% damni</style> inferentibus et iaculatore missilium <style=cIsDamage>150% damni</style> inferente concesso.",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SPECIAL_FOLLOW_NAME": "Mandatum Sequendi",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SPECIAL_FOLLOW_DESCRIPTION": "Squall ad te revoca et <color=#00FF00>Modum Sequendi</color> activa, eum prope te manere faciens.",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SPECIAL_CANCEL_NAME": "Cancella Modum Mandati",
    "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SPECIAL_CANCEL_DESCRIPTION": "Modum Mandati cancellat.",
    "BOG_SQUALL_BODY_NAME": "Squall",
    "BOG_SQUALL_BODY_PICKUP": "Falco roboticus fidelis Pathfinder.",
    "BOG_SQUALL_BODY_DESCRIPTION": "Falco roboticus qui Pathfinder comitatur. Squall pleraque obiecta Pathfinder hereditat et <style=cIsUtility>deleri non potest</style>.",
    "BOG_SQUALL_BODY_SKILL_DESCRIPTION": "Sclopetis fixis et missilibus hostes petit in <color=#FF0000>Modo Impetendi</color>, et scopos repetite ferit cum iubetur <style=cIsDamage>Pete Iugulum</style>.",
    "BOG_SQUALL_BODY_DEFAULT_SKIN_NAME": "Ordinarius",
